      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "A Wickguard pistol and holster; his papers; the brass key with the filigree \"B\" for room 616; keys to his gig and house; an Emagico key-token labelled MARBAS on a strip of paper; an envelope of burnt paper scraps; a small silver pill-box carved with the laughing face of a child whose eyes have been scratched out, holding half a dozen rotten milk teeth (Unease, if the character saw him swallow one); and numbered, handwritten pages of the play stuffed inside his clothes. Passing strange: Barbas was born on 30 Bearing 655, the night Her Grey Song opened and closed; his house was finished on 21 Blossoming 624, the same day as the Macallister Building, and on Emeline Fitzroy's birthday.",
